                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.00/3283: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dodd</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-07-01T12:00:00-04:00">July 1, 1934—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>82. Your 124, June 30, 5 p.m. I should appreciate your sending a series of
                    frequent brief analytic telegrams during the current German crisis.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
